<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Global Fuel Price Trends & Policy Impact Analysis (2020–2026)</title>
<style>
:root{--primary:#1a2e4a;--accent:#2e5c8a;--muted:#5a6b7c;--bg:#f7f9fb;--card:#ffffff;--border:#dde3e9;}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{font-family:"Segoe UI",Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:#222;line-height:1.55}
.container{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:28px}
header{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--primary),#2e5c8a);color:#fff;padding:38px 28px;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px;margin-bottom:28px}
header h1{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:1.9rem}
header p{margin:0;opacity:.92;font-size:1.05rem}
.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:22px 26px;margin-bottom:22px;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.04)}
.card h2{margin:0 0 14px;font-size:1.35rem;color:var(--primary);border-bottom:2px solid var(--border);padding-bottom:8px}
.card h3{margin:18px 0 10px;font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--accent)}
.kpi-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(180px,1fr));gap:14px;margin-bottom:10px}
.kpi{background:#f0f4f8;border-radius:8px;padding:16px;text-align:center;border-left:4px solid var(--accent)}
.kpi .value{font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--primary)}
.kpi .label{font-size:.82rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:4px}
.chart{margin:18px 0;text-align:center}
.chart img{max-width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid var(--border)}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:12px 0;font-size:.95rem}
th,td{border:1px solid var(--border);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left}
th{background:#eef2f7;color:var(--primary);font-weight:600}
tr:nth-child(even){background:#fafbfc}
.highlight{background:#fff8e1;border-left:4px solid #f4a261;padding:12px 14px;border-radius:6px;margin:10px 0}
.findings ol{padding-left:20px}
.findings li{margin-bottom:10px}
